{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9f1c4b70-23127178-4aa1-9c31-mini-applycoupon",
    "name": "Mini API Testing - POST /api/apply-coupon (23127178)",
    "description": "Bo kich ban kiem thu tu dong (data-driven) cho API POST /api/apply-coupon cua eshop-sut.\n\n- SUT: backend/server.js (Express + SQLite), port 3000\n- Chay bang Collection Runner hoac Newman voi --iteration-data mini-apply-coupon.data.json (5 iteration)\n- Moi assertion deu doc gia tri ky vong tu iteration data (expected_status, expected_discount_amount, ...) nen cung 1 request phuc vu ca positive, negative va boundary case.\n- Tien to test: 'Functional:' = hanh vi nghiep vu, 'Contract:' = schema/kieu du lieu, 'Regression-lock:' = khoa hanh vi sai da biet (BUG-01/BUG-02).\n\nMSSV: 23127178",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "requestBody",
      "value": "{}",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Body JSON duoc dung dong trong pre-request script tu iteration data."
    },
    {
      "key": "endpointPath",
      "value": "/api/apply-coupon",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Apply Coupon (Data-driven)",
      "description": "Folder chua request data-driven duy nhat. Newman chay 1 request x 5 iteration = 5 lan thuc thi.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST {{endpointPath}} - {{tc_id}}",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// ============================================================",
                  "// PRE-REQUEST SCRIPT",
                  "// 1. Gan header X-Student-Id (bat buoc theo de bai B4.3)",
                  "// 2. Dung body JSON tu iteration data, cho phep BO HAN 1 field",
                  "//    (de test truong hop thieu field required)",
                  "// ============================================================",
                  "",
                  "pm.request.headers.upsert({",
                  "  key: \"X-Student-Id\",",
                  "  value: pm.environment.get(\"studentId\"),",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const d = pm.iterationData;",
                  "const body = {};",
                  "",
                  "// Chi bo field khi data file khai bao tuong minh send_<field> = false.",
                  "if (d.get(\"send_code\") !== false) body.code = d.get(\"code\");",
                  "if (d.get(\"send_total_amount\") !== false) body.total_amount = d.get(\"total_amount\");",
                  "if (d.get(\"send_user_id\") !== false) body.user_id = d.get(\"user_id\");",
                  "",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"requestBody\", JSON.stringify(body));",
                  "",
                  "console.log(",
                  "  `>>> [${d.get(\"tc_id\")}] ${d.get(\"title\")}`",
                  ");",
                  "console.log(`    body gui di: ${JSON.stringify(body)}`);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// ============================================================",
                  "// TEST SCRIPT - moi ky vong lay tu iteration data",
                  "// ============================================================",
                  "const d = pm.iterationData;",
                  "const tc = d.get(\"tc_id\");",
                  "const expectedStatus = Number(d.get(\"expected_status\"));",
                  "const knownBug = d.get(\"known_bug\");",
                  "const lock = knownBug ? `Regression-lock(${knownBug})` : \"Functional\";",
                  "",
                  "// ---- 1. Status code -----------------------------------------",
                  "pm.test(`[MINI] ${tc} ${lock}: status code = ${expectedStatus}`, function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(expectedStatus);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// ---- 2. Assertion tu viet (yeu cau B4.3): Content-Type ------",
                  "pm.test(\"[MINI] Response is JSON\", function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Type\")).to.include(",
                  "    \"application/json\",",
                  "  );",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// ---- 3. Assertion tu viet (yeu cau B4.3): response time -----",
                  "pm.test(\"[MINI] Functional: response time < 1000ms\", function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// ---- 4. Chung minh header X-Student-Id da duoc gui ----------",
                  "const studentId = String(pm.environment.get(\"studentId\"));",
                  "pm.test(`[MINI] Request carries X-Student-Id = ${studentId}`, function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.request.headers.get(\"X-Student-Id\")).to.eql(studentId);",
                  "});",
                  "console.log(",
                  "  `    X-Student-Id thuc gui: ${pm.request.headers.get(\"X-Student-Id\")}`,",
                  ");",
                  "",
                  "// ---- 5. Body phai la JSON object ---------------------------",
                  "let json = {};",
                  "pm.test(\"[MINI] Contract: body parse duoc thanh JSON object\", function () {",
                  "  json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.be.an(\"object\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (expectedStatus === 200) {",
                  "  // ---- 6a. Schema cua response thanh cong -------------------",
                  "  const successSchema = {",
                  "    type: \"object\",",
                  "    required: [",
                  "      \"success\",",
                  "      \"coupon_id\",",
                  "      \"discount_amount\",",
                  "      \"final_amount\",",
                  "      \"message\",",
                  "    ],",
                  "    properties: {",
                  "      success: { type: \"boolean\" },",
                  "      coupon_id: { type: \"integer\" },",
                  "      discount_amount: { type: \"number\" },",
                  "      final_amount: { type: \"number\" },",
                  "      message: { type: \"string\" },",
                  "    },",
                  "    additionalProperties: false,",
                  "  };",
                  "  pm.test(",
                  "    `[MINI] ${tc} Contract: success response dung JSON Schema`,",
                  "    function () {",
                  "      pm.response.to.have.jsonSchema(successSchema);",
                  "    },",
                  "  );",
                  "",
                  "  pm.test(`[MINI] ${tc} Contract: success === true`, function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  });",
                  "",
                  "  // ---- 6b. Gia tri nghiep vu (tach rieng khoi schema) ------",
                  "  const expCoupon = d.get(\"expected_coupon_id\");",
                  "  if (expCoupon !== undefined && expCoupon !== null && expCoupon !== \"\") {",
                  "    pm.test(`[MINI] ${tc} Functional: coupon_id = ${expCoupon}`, function () {",
                  "      pm.expect(pm.response.json().coupon_id).to.eql(Number(expCoupon));",
                  "    });",
                  "  }",
                  "",
                  "  const expDiscount = d.get(\"expected_discount_amount\");",
                  "  if (expDiscount !== undefined && expDiscount !== null && expDiscount !== \"\") {",
                  "    pm.test(",
                  "      `[MINI] ${tc} ${lock}: discount_amount = ${expDiscount}`,",
                  "      function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(pm.response.json().discount_amount).to.eql(",
                  "          Number(expDiscount),",
                  "        );",
                  "      },",
                  "    );",
                  "  }",
                  "",
                  "  const expFinal = d.get(\"expected_final_amount\");",
                  "  if (expFinal !== undefined && expFinal !== null && expFinal !== \"\") {",
                  "    pm.test(",
                  "      `[MINI] ${tc} ${lock}: final_amount = ${expFinal}`,",
                  "      function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(pm.response.json().final_amount).to.eql(Number(expFinal));",
                  "      },",
                  "    );",
                  "  }",
                  "",
                  "  const msgFrag = d.get(\"expected_message_contains\");",
                  "  if (msgFrag) {",
                  "    pm.test(",
                  "      `[MINI] ${tc} Functional: message chua \"${msgFrag}\"`,",
                  "      function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.include(msgFrag);",
                  "      },",
                  "    );",
                  "  }",
                  "} else {",
                  "  // ---- 7a. Schema cua response loi -------------------------",
                  "  const errorSchema = {",
                  "    type: \"object\",",
                  "    required: [\"error\"],",
                  "    properties: { error: { type: \"string\", minLength: 1 } },",
                  "  };",
                  "  pm.test(",
                  "    `[MINI] ${tc} Contract: error response dung JSON Schema`,",
                  "    function () {",
                  "      pm.response.to.have.jsonSchema(errorSchema);",
                  "    },",
                  "  );",
                  "",
                  "  // ---- 7b. Noi dung message loi (khong chi check status) ---",
                  "  const errFrag = d.get(\"expected_error_contains\");",
                  "  if (errFrag) {",
                  "    pm.test(",
                  "      `[MINI] ${tc} ${lock}: error message chua \"${errFrag}\"`,",
                  "      function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.include(errFrag);",
                  "      },",
                  "    );",
                  "  }",
                  "",
                  "  // ---- 7c. Khong duoc ro ri du lieu giam gia khi that bai --",
                  "  pm.test(",
                  "    `[MINI] ${tc} Functional: response loi khong tra ve discount/final_amount`,",
                  "    function () {",
                  "      const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "      pm.expect(b).to.not.have.property(\"discount_amount\");",
                  "      pm.expect(b).to.not.have.property(\"final_amount\");",
                  "      pm.expect(b).to.not.have.property(\"success\");",
                  "    },",
                  "  );",
                  "",
                  "  // ---- 7d. Khong duoc lo stack trace / thong tin noi bo -----",
                  "  pm.test(",
                  "    `[MINI] ${tc} Functional: error message khong lo chi tiet noi bo (SQL/stack)`,",
                  "    function () {",
                  "      const msg = String(pm.response.json().error).toLowerCase();",
                  "      pm.expect(msg).to.not.include(\"sqlite\");",
                  "      pm.expect(msg).to.not.include(\"select \");",
                  "      pm.expect(msg).to.not.include(\"at object.\");",
                  "    },",
                  "  );",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "// ---- 8. Ghi chu bug da biet ra Console ----------------------",
                  "if (knownBug) {",
                  "  console.log(",
                  "    `    /!\\\\ ${knownBug}: spec ky vong status ${d.get(\"spec_expected_status\")}. ${d.get(\"spec_note\")}`,",
                  "  );",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{{requestBody}}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}{{endpointPath}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}{{endpointPath}}"]
            },
            "description": "Ap dung ma giam gia. Body: { code, total_amount, user_id }.\n\n- 200: { success, coupon_id, discount_amount, final_amount, message }\n- 400: thieu code / don chua du min_order_amount / ma het han / vuot max_uses_per_user\n- 404: ma khong ton tai hoac is_active = 0"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
